{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921191831_790733c8","chunk_index":7,"job_id":"mwjob_96ee70138c21a86568eb3f3d","precondition_digest":"add80477183785ba79699a9684934e87a513c10a828d5eef390807a81dd8fa35","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v4","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fc00c21a15e837a8","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_469d7df8436fa4a2","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_503d4369748f76ae","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5cffa5a750f97bfc"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921191831_790733c8","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_packet_6_1","span_proj_product_profile","span_proj_dose","span_proj_design"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验用药品包括合成试验药A及其匹配安慰剂。合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂，给药途径为口服，给药方案为100 mg每日一次（QD），自第1天至第16周；匹配安慰剂采用相同的口服给药途径和每日一次给药频次，于双盲治疗期第1天至第16周给药。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验药组或对照组，接受双盲治疗。研究期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性。本章依次说明研究药物信息，以及试验用药品的制备、包装、标签、储存与管理，发放、回收与清点要求。","rationale":"合成试验药A的剂型、给药途径、剂量、给药频次和给药周期，匹配安慰剂的给药安排，以及受试者按1:1随机分配和依从性评价方式，均有当前项目研究定义支持。医学作者需核对试验用药品的规格、包装标签信息、储存条件及发放回收管理要求是否需从研究者手册或药品管理文件补充。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_fc00c21a15e837a8","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:183d28058c2111323674fe0a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921191831_790733c8","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_packet_6_1_1","span_proj_identity","span_proj_product_profile","span_proj_dose","span_proj_design"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"研究药物为合成试验药A，属于小分子药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，给药途径为口服。本研究中合成试验药A的给药剂量为100 mg，每日一次（QD），自第1天至第16周。对照药物为匹配安慰剂，采用相同的口服给药途径和每日一次给药频次，于双盲治疗期第1天至第16周给药。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验药组或对照组。研究期间通过药品计数及受试者日记评价受试者对研究药物的依从性。本研究为III期确证性临床研究，研究人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。","rationale":"研究药物名称、技术类型、剂型、给药途径、剂量、给药频次、给药周期、匹配安慰剂安排、随机分配比例及依从性评价方式均有当前项目研究定义支持。医学作者需核对是否补充作用机制、规格、辅料、批号或编码规则及储存条件；当前项目来源未提供上述信息。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_469d7df8436fa4a2","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:183d28058c2111323674fe0a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921191831_790733c8","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品研究者手册（IB）或产品说明书","试验用药品包装、标签与储存条件资料","试验用药品稳定性研究资料","试验用药品管理SOP或药房手册"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"试验用药品的制备、包装、标签、储存与管理缺少项目特定资料来源，无法写入具体做法。合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂、100 mg每日一次口服至第16周以及匹配安慰剂安排已由当前项目研究定义支持，但不足以支撑本章节所需的包装、标签与储存管理内容。医学作者需取得研究者手册或产品说明书、包装标签样稿、稳定性与储存条件资料及药品管理文件后撰写本章节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_503d4369748f76ae","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:183d28058c2111323674fe0a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921191831_790733c8","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5cffa5a750f97bfc","fact_path":"picos.intervention_summary","options":[{"label":"研究中心纸质记录与监查核对","option_id":"opt_a","summary":"由研究中心授权药品管理人员按访视进行发放和回收，使用纸质记录单逐例记录，监查员定期核对清点结果。"},{"label":"中心药房电子记录","option_id":"opt_b","summary":"由研究中心药房按机构流程发放和回收，使用中心药品管理电子记录，研究者确认清点结果并在eCRF中录入。"},{"label":"统一模板与中心执行","option_id":"opt_c","summary":"由申办者提供统一药品管理记录模板，研究中心按其流程完成发放、回收和清点并留存记录。"}],"question":"试验用药品发放、回收与清点的记录载体和责任分工应如何确定？","rationale":"当前项目仅明确通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性，未规定记录载体和责任分工；统一模板有助于保持多中心记录一致性，但仍需结合中心药品管理流程确认。","recommended_option_id":"opt_c"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_packet_6_1_3","span_proj_compliance","span_proj_dose","span_proj_epochs"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"发放、回收与清点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节规定试验用药品在研究中心内的发放、回收与清点要求。试验用药品发放应覆盖双盲治疗期，使受试者能够按方案接受合成试验药A或匹配安慰剂。回收与清点应保证试验用药品数量可核对，并与药品计数及受试者日记结果相互印证，以支持依从性评价。对于数量差异、药品破损、丢失或误用等情况，应予记录并评估。相关记录应能够追溯每例受试者所接受试验用药品的流向，并满足试验用药品管理的一般要求。","rationale":"当前项目研究定义明确双盲治疗期为第1天至第16周，依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价；但未规定发放、回收与清点的记录载体、责任分工、差异处理和回收后处理方式。正文仅描述本章节应覆盖的目的与范围，不将可选做法写成既定要求。医学作者需结合中心药品管理流程和申办者要求确认决定项。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5cffa5a750f97bfc","section_number":"6.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:183d28058c2111323674fe0a","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:183d28058c2111323674fe0a","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:183d28058c2111323674fe0a","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"f89e31a51efcb308010497c7200dc062518355307a7be411059d582b784eec16"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"locator":"section:5. AD 部位拍照：将在预设访视点对受试者 AD 皮损部位进行拍照，具体拍摄要求详见《特应性皮炎皮损部位拍照流程及要求》。如受试者因特殊情况|block:225|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b24da94f33534","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"5b666f365d97c08cc0b89f4385d4c2eae4c9a88144f60a3b1524e66c86391897"},{"locator":"section:治疗药物|block:103|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:bb9c14bf455dec","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7375ac7241c2627eeb54b287a15f75832e33a6fc655f40545738b9f13c31a384"},{"locator":"section:表3. 研究药物给药方案|block:478|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6eab08a4bddb3d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"397548cdd2222ca606599d07a45451fb1f6330b576d8c186d50126d7e8737a90"},{"locator":"section:IMP的储存、管理与发放|block:483|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f24b1a78f9c3f8","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"6bd1543fac3d184ef68f0f4e5c2eb8c382829bbbefe6cce8f9627ca1008b66cb"}]}